<html><body>
[[Logo]]
<p>Hello [[SignerName]],</p>
<p>Use this code to open <strong>[[DocumentName]]</strong>:</p>
<p style="font-size:28px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:6px">[[Passcode]]</p>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:12px">The code expires in [[PasscodeMinutes]] minutes. If you did not ask for it, you can ignore this email: nobody can open the document without it.</p>
</body></html>
